    "description": "There are  population data of Antarctic fur seal from reproductive season\n1982-83 up the present. The first censuses correspond to counts without\nseparation in etarial category, this separation started in  the reproductive\nseason 1986-87. The data have been analyzed and published. On the basis of the\ndata estocastic model of population growth has been designed.",
